Tester 49243: with the goal open the owner typed „ლევანის პასუხი
დამეხმარა"; the thank-you went at once (D756), then the run called
finish_task, was refused „NOT CLOSED", and asked „ამით საქმე გადაწყდა?"
with three buttons. D756's DONE WHEN is no card and no question.

In a run whose owner line says a helper helped (saysAHelperHelped), and
where the owner has not called the goal solved:
- finish_task is refused with a note to say only that the thanks went;
- present_choices with the „გადაწყდა" button is refused the same way.

The goal stays open until the owner says it is done. A line that says
both „solved" and „helped" still closes as before.

DONE WHEN: „<helper>-ის პასუხი დამეხმარა" with the goal open, on 2 fresh
pairs — the helper is thanked, and the owner sees no question and no
buttons.

